    "body": "We actually have to invoke the constructor, otherwise the dictionary initialization doesn't take place and attributes wouldn't have their initial values. That's why we started using this for `document.createEvent()` and such.\n\nWe could maybe create a shortcut for this in DOM that would also set isTrusted to true (since that's typically what you need). What do you think?\n",
